Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.35,0:00:05.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好猛喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人跟店家都超多的耶
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.10,0:00:09.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,地下城市集啦
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.97,0:00:11.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就跟辦慶典差不多
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.40,0:00:14.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為地下城重置了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.25,0:00:17.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冒險者為了搶新刷的寶箱湧過來
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.05,0:00:20.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,商人就跟著來賺冒險者的錢\N差不多是這意思
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.17,0:00:30.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走啦 快點去買衣服
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.75,0:00:34.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都怪你把莉露的衣服燒掉啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.45,0:00:38.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.77,0:00:43.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我只是想把衣服烘乾啦
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.42,0:00:45.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我真的不太會用魔法石
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個是！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.07,0:00:47.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.02,0:00:52.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.37,0:00:56.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個是好東西…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露的直覺就是這樣說的…
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.12,0:01:03.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小妹妹 眼光不錯啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是什麼蛋啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.82,0:01:09.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰知道？我是路上撿到的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.37,0:01:12.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我占卜到它是“幸運之蛋”喔
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.12,0:01:14.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,占卜？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.35,0:01:17.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幸運之蛋啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,信不信隨便你
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是精靈大人的指引啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.47,0:01:25.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,精靈大人？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.70,0:01:26.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走了莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.82,0:01:28.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等一下 始！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這真的是好東西啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.05,0:01:33.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不買一定會後悔的！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？你在說什麼啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.17,0:01:37.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拜託！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.22,0:01:40.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,相信莉露身為冒險者的直覺嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.82,0:01:43.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你的冒險者直覺？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.42,0:01:47.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拜託！相信莉露的冒險者直覺！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.05,0:01:55.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,願精靈大人的祝福臨到各位手足！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.92,0:02:00.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝你啦
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那這要怎麼吃？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以吃啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.77,0:02:17.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,痛痛… 對不起啦
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我站住 安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.42,0:02:21.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.30,0:03:59.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:02.05,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第3話　莉露與安揚戈）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很適合你喔 莉露
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.70,0:04:05.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你品味還不錯嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是娜塔莉的品味好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.90,0:04:10.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.37,0:04:15.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們要去重置後的地下城吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.70,0:04:16.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露的蛋！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.30,0:04:23.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.57,0:04:28.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,變… 變成這副樣子了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,把它交給始保管是莉露不對…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.57,0:04:34.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請原諒我啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.92,0:04:35.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,笨蛋喔…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拿去…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.15,0:04:44.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是好險！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.75,0:04:47.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始 我們快點！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.35,0:04:48.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不趕快去地下城的話
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.07,0:04:51.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,寶箱就會被人清光啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.45,0:04:53.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你要穿那身衣服去嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我去換衣服！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.85,0:05:00.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.20,0:05:05.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,照理說駐村的冒險者\N應該把寶箱機會讓給外來隊伍…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣換來的是更划算的委託…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.90,0:05:15.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過她連史萊姆都打得跌跌撞撞
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說到底也到不了寶箱那區啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.97,0:05:21.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可惡… 還挺會打的嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.85,0:05:22.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,到此為止啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.92,0:05:42.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是剛剛那個矮人小鬼啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.85,0:05:44.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等等 怎麼會有小孩自己一個…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.70,0:05:49.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可惡！這畫面好眼熟啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.60,0:05:55.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超麻煩的啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.40,0:06:02.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這… 笨孫女啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我孫女給你添麻煩了 年輕人
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是東雲始
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,目前在這村子當駐村冒險者
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我有聽過你的事蹟喔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.32,0:06:18.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,撿到小孩還願意照顧的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很善良的冒險者嘛…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.10,0:06:22.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,善良？你說啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我孫女也承蒙你幫忙了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來傳聞沒說錯呢
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我可是超冷酷的喔
Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.77,0:06:33.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且對冒險者來說
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.30,0:06:35.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“善良”可不算稱讚耶…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始是個溫柔的人嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.35,0:06:41.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始超溫柔的啦
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聽我把話說完！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.85,0:06:44.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,痛痛…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.90,0:06:47.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聽好喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.07,0:06:49.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你可是女孩子
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.07,0:06:53.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別老往地下城跑\N多待在家裡乖一點…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.07,0:06:54.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才不要！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.15,0:06:56.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的… 因為沒了父母
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以我可能寵她寵過頭了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她沒有爸爸媽媽嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以前被魔獸…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:12.10,0:07:13.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真傷腦筋…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.27,0:07:16.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她這樣八成又要跑去地下城了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.45,0:07:21.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是有個信得過的大人能陪著她就好了…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.65,0:07:25.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是報酬的問題！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我壓穩了！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.70,0:07:54.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊？你在吼誰啊混帳！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.82,0:07:58.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,用腰力給我砸下去啊你這細手臂！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.95,0:08:00.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好帥喔…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剛才那個呼 冒出來的是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.10,0:08:08.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,火之精靈啊
Dialogue: 2,0:08:08.70,0:08:09.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,精靈？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.20,0:08:11.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.72,0:08:14.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,矮人的鍛造師
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.70,0:08:17.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能把那傢伙鎮住才算出師
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也想快點變強
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.47,0:08:22.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早點站上鍛造台
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不能等你長大再說嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,奶奶活不久了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.65,0:08:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她真的老了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我不能再拖拖拉拉的…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.40,0:08:44.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想快點讓她看到我出師的樣子
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想讓人看到自己能獨當一面的樣子…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.37,0:08:54.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要當我的夥伴就別哭！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露也跟安揚戈有點像
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？我跟你？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.42,0:09:05.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露 要不要請始幫忙一下？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我去問問看吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.07,0:09:11.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的知心好友啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.32,0:09:15.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你剛剛跑去哪了？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.27,0:09:19.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個啊 始…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈也一起…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你叫安揚戈對吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.32,0:09:26.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以後我偶爾會帶你
Dialogue: 2,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別一個人自己跑到地下城去了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太棒啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了耶 安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.15,0:09:40.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-哈哈… 謝啦！\N-駐村好累喔…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.95,0:10:02.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我成功了！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:07.40,0:10:08.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的知心好友呀！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:09.85,0:10:10.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,朋友啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-那種溫吞的交情我實在搞不懂\N-知心好友！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過對她這弱雞來說或許需要吧…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露也是始教你的嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這套打法…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來始先生很可靠耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.85,0:10:38.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事 完全沒事！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.80,0:10:44.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈 再試一次看看吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.47,0:10:50.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉啦
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.82,0:10:52.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？還拖小怪過來啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.00,0:10:55.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真對不起
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.12,0:10:57.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露！你跟安揚戈先撤到牆邊！！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.82,0:10:59.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這邊！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.95,0:11:05.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安… 安揚戈？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.00,0:11:19.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走了喔…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.25,0:11:25.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.57,0:11:34.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你… 不覺得冷嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇… 薇洛妮卡嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傢伙在動什麼歪腦筋時\N我都會起雞皮疙瘩耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈你還好吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝啦我的好朋友！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,安揚戈跟莉露…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:49.97,0:11:51.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是朋友喔
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.90,0:11:54.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,朋友的東西
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以搶喔？
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,薇洛妮卡！你在哪？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.10,0:12:02.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:08.92,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.37,0:12:12.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.50,0:12:15.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可惡… 要是我再強一點就好了！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.27,0:12:19.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你對我朋友想幹嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.57,0:12:21.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.95,0:12:28.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,吃我…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這招啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:36.35,0:12:37.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幫大忙了 莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不愧是我的好朋友！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始… 始…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！莉露剛剛用出魔法了喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.05,0:13:06.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剛才莉露用魔法救了你跟安揚戈！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.17,0:13:11.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嘣的一聲！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剛才？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:13.12,0:13:15.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你不是整個人睡死了嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一定是莉露體內
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.47,0:13:20.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,寄宿著很厲害的力量沒錯啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:20.45,0:13:21.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那也是在夢裡啦
Dialogue: 2,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,魔法要怎麼才能用出來啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.52,0:13:27.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果能用魔法
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.82,0:13:31.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,或許更能幫上始的忙喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.50,0:13:33.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你現在也沒多有用吧
Dialogue: 2,0:13:34.67,0:13:35.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再說我…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對魔法有點…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.82,0:13:40.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然對精靈術有興趣
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.62,0:13:44.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要不要去測一下\N莉露的精靈屬性呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,精靈術？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.67,0:13:50.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她的？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.62,0:13:51.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.37,0:13:54.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我開動囉
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.77,0:13:57.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,搞不好她用魔法比揮劍更像樣啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.42,0:14:05.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去測一次也無妨
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露的精靈屬性是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.35,0:14:14.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,上次不是把你的衣服燒了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個是…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.35,0:14:19.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,用道具借來火之精靈的力量啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,火之精靈…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是跟安揚戈在工房看到的那個！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.20,0:14:29.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,火、水、土、風…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,平常是看不到
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.92,0:14:35.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但這世界就是有那些精靈在四處飛來飛去
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露想要…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:42.05,0:14:44.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會爆炸的那種比較好
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,轟的那種！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.67,0:14:53.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想了解莉露的精靈術傾向…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.70,0:14:55.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很好的想法呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.40,0:14:57.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這邊請
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,婆婆你是誰呀？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.55,0:15:05.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是傳講太陽教義的教會婆婆喔
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.15,0:15:11.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你對很久很久以前的\N太陽故事有興趣呀？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.97,0:15:20.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呃… 可能沒有很有興趣啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,正因為是冒險者
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這些知識更該掌握
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知識就是力量！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我最怕這種難懂的課了…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.60,0:15:45.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,鹽…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.02,0:15:46.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,黃金…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.75,0:15:49.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,獨眼貓頭鷹…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,選別之太陽
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去選別之森吧 交給你了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.97,0:16:18.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始不跟去嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要查的是你的傾向\N當然你自己去
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.40,0:16:35.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有什麼狀況我再出手救你
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去冒險吧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:39.90,0:16:40.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我出發囉！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.62,0:16:50.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,初次優惠是銀幣五枚
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.12,0:16:52.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是死要錢…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:56.27,0:16:57.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是這樣啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.97,0:17:00.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一點都不可怕啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.15,0:17:16.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那群傢伙是什麼啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.35,0:17:48.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那傢伙到底是怎樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.20,0:17:50.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是超危險的眼睛啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.85,0:17:55.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有什麼狀況我再出手救你
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.17,0:17:57.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去冒險吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,冒險！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.80,0:18:04.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露是冒險者！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.87,0:18:07.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這點小事沒什麼啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:34.45,0:18:36.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.77,0:18:39.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超大的水窪耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好舒服喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.65,0:18:53.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好… 好大！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.50,0:19:00.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你… 你要打嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放… 放馬過來啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.95,0:19:06.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你… 你這種
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.45,0:19:09.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遇到莉露一下就會被打倒啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是不過來
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就換我上了！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.07,0:19:13.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,出了事別怪我！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,給我受死吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.77,0:19:25.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,必殺！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露砂塵暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.92,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（然而毫無效果）
Dialogue: 2,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露的冒險就到此為止了…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.85,0:19:39.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:39.85,0:19:41.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始需要莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:53.32,0:19:54.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好冰！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.57,0:19:59.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,上面畫了怪圖案耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.67,0:20:10.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.72,0:20:11.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這麼快啊
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有遇到什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.35,0:20:21.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露遇到一隻長鬍子的超大烏龜！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.62,0:20:26.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大鬍子的大烏龜…\N難不成是千年翁？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:27.45,0:20:31.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來水之精靈很喜歡莉露呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:34.77,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（不管幾次都遇不到像樣的精靈）
Dialogue: 2,0:20:34.35,0:20:37.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,然後… 身上被畫了圖！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:37.20,0:20:39.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連加護都拿到了呀？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.95,0:20:42.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,水的紋樣加上兩片鱗片…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,巨水之加護呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.00,0:20:47.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,巨水之… 加護？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.77,0:20:49.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算不用精靈具
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,水之精靈也會在一定程度上借你力量
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.35,0:20:54.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是很難得的喔
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露得到很厲害的東西了！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.45,0:21:04.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來是喔
Dialogue: 2,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,始！去地下城試試看啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.17,0:21:12.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也把安揚戈叫來！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛啦 始！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快點去地下城啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.32,0:21:21.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦好啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:26.00,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（史萊姆出現了！）
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.20,0:21:32.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,終於到了讓你們見識\N莉露必殺力量的時候！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.92,0:21:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就是莉露的魔法！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:48.25,0:21:49.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:50.80,0:21:51.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你還好吧 莉露！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:52.35,0:21:55.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等我 我現在就來救你
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.15,0:22:03.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟想像中的完全不一樣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:40.12,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（下回 初戀的去向）
